===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|nynthe}}, {{m|enm|nynte}}, from {{inh|en|ang|niġoþa}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*newundô}}; the ''-n-'' was reinserted by analogy with {{m|en|nine}}.

